# OSG Preset Persistence

- Serialized presets use **`schemaVersion`** (see `osgPresetSchemaVersion` in `osg_models.dart`). If JSON shape or required fields change, bump the version and implement decode migration for older versions when applicable.
- If new fields affect **ZIP preset packs** (`osg_preset_pack_zip.dart` or related), verify export and import round-trip and asset paths.
- After model changes, update **editor** controls and any **playout / preview** layers that read the new fields so draft and live behavior stay aligned.
